  "text": "Even if you've never bought diesel, you're paying for it.\n\nDiesel just hit a record $6.53 a gallon, almost 77% higher than last year. America's diesel savings are down to less than four weeks of cover, heating oil bills are set to jump by around $550 this winter, and Trump's big plan to fix it could make gas prices worse too.\n\nIn this video, We'll break down:\nWhy diesel prices hit a record high in 2026, and whether Gas Stations are actually running empty nationwide.\nHow the Strait of Hormuz crisis and Russia's diesel export ban created a global refinery shortage\nWhy harvest season, trucking and winter heating oil demand are all hitting America's diesel supply at once\nHow record diesel prices feed into inflation, interest rates and Federal Reserve rate hikes\nTrump's diesel export ban threat and the outlook for 2027\n----\nSupport Our Work:    / @monkeyexplains1999  \n----\nMusic Used in Order of Appearance -    • 2027 US Diesel Crisis (Music Used)  \nSauce - https://pastebin.com/1F63TMnn\nSpotify - https://open.spotify.com/show/033JDMn...\n----\nAI Disclosure: I want to be clear about how we create our videos. We're a small team of actual people and all of the visuals you see are hand-drawn.\n\nAI is used ONLY for Dubbing/Narration. Most of the team, including myself are based in South East Asia and English isn't our best language. I personally had negative experiences being bullied for my Singaporean Accent when I worked in the marketing industry. And now, considering the subjects of our videos - this is a way to help protect the identity of everyone working on this channel. \n\nI’ve made sure to pick the most human-sounding option so it doesn’t distract you from the videos we put out. Everything from scripting, jokes, references, editing, and overall creativity, is 100% me and my amazing team of animators and illustrators. Thanks for supporting our work!\n----\nif u r reading dis type \"Oilmaxxing\"",
